  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>숗<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>볟<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>해<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>활<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/S3JYu8Tkios?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>為<rt>위-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>環境<rt>환곙ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>當<rt>당ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>完成<rt>완솅ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    wi-tioh-hoan-kièng boe-tàng-lai-oan-siéng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby title=\"hît\">彼<rt>힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>段<rt>돨-</rt></ruby><ruby>永遠<rt>옝ˆ완ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>難忘<rt>란뻥ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>戀情<rt>롼졩ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hît-toa̰-yêng-oân-lan-bōng’e loan-jiéng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>孤單<rt>거ˉ돨ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>來到<rt>래ᄀᅷˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>昔日<rt>셱ˆ띧ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>海岸<rt>해ˆ활ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kōr-toā̰-lai-kàu-siêk-rît&#8217;e hâi-hoā̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>景致<rt>곙ˆ디</rt></ruby> <ruby>猶原<rt>유꽌-</rt></ruby><ruby>也<rt>야-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>改變<rt>개ˆ볜</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kiêng-ti yu-goan-ya-bo-kâi-pien\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>不平靜<rt>붇ˆ볭졩ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>海湧聲<rt>해ˆ옝ˆ샬ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    pût-pieng-jiēng’e hâi-yêng-siâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>像<rt>츌-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>不平靜<rt>붇ˆ볭졩ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>心情<rt>심ˉ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chiṵ-gûn-pût-pieng-jiēng’e sīm-jiéng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>아<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby>離別<rt>리볟ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>情景<rt>졩곙ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ā li-piêt’e jieng-kièng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>浮<rt>푸-</rt></ruby><ruby>在<rt>재-</rt></ruby><ruby>眼前<rt>깐ˆ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    phu-jai-gân-jiéng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>雖然<rt>쉬ˉ뗸-</rt></ruby><ruby>一切<rt>읻ˆ체</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>環境<rt>환곙ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>造成<rt>조솅ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sūi-rien-ît-che lông-si-hoan-kièng lai-jo-siéng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>對<rt>뒤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>感情<rt>감ˆ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>也<rt>야-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>變<rt>볜</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tùi-lì’e kâm-jiéng ya-si-bo-pien\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>也<rt>야-</rt></ruby><ruby>永遠<rt>옝ˆ완ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>期待<rt>기태ˉ</rt></ruby>’됴\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà ya-yêng-oân-ki-thāi&#8217;tio\n  </sp